2026-07-27T07:48:12.3501011Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T07:48:12.3501525Z i /tmp/RtmpeHn5a5/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:48:12.3501874Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:48:12.3502287Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:48:12.3502938Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:48:12.3503784Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:48:12.3504657Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:48:12.3505285Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
