2026-07-27T07:48:12.3798458Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:48:12.4145052Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:48:12.4257930Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
